        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">Complete sewer system, DN 300, profile 2 according to SIA 190.Trench depth 3 meters. Reinforced concrete pipe, 300 mm, outer diameter 440 mm, wall thickness 70 mm, 225 kg/m, 2770 kg/m³. A1-A5 and C1-C4\n\n# Included processes\nThis process models 1 meter of sewer system infrastructure with reinforced concrete pipe, DN 300, profile 2 according to SIA 190. Trench depth: 3 meters. This process includes the production phase (A1–A3), the construction phase/ transport (A4–A5) as well as deconstruction phase (C1), transport phase (C2), treatment/ recycling phase (C3), and final disposal phase (C4) for one meter of sewer system with reinforced concrete pipe.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
